# Artificial Evolution changes the text of Myr Battlesphere's spell, Myr to Goblin (CR 612.1, 400.7a): it makes four
# Goblin artifact creature tokens (CR 612.4) and, attacking, taps "X untapped Goblins you control" for +X/+0 and X
# damage. Bot1 taps three of the tokens: 7 power, and 3 damage first, so 20 - 3 - 7 = 10.

